OL,3,A'We simply don't know' - JP Morgan
OL,4,Astruggling to forecast oil prices due
OL,5,Ato US-Iran war
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt said such red lines included oil
OL,8,Fprices rising above $100 a barrel,
OL,9,Finflation rising to 4%, gasoline
OL,10,Ftopping $5 a gallon and interest rates
OL,11,Fon 10-year government borrowing hitting
OL,12,F5%.
OL,14,F"The market is on edge," analysts said.
